ADDITIONAL NOTICE — EDUCATIONAL SOFTWARE ONLY

This software is a simplified, fictional teaching simulator. It is NOT suitable
for and MUST NOT be used for: operating any real nuclear reactor or plant;
engineering, safety, or accident analysis; licensing or regulatory work;
operator training for which credit is claimed or certification is granted; or
modelling any specific real facility. All numeric values, setpoints, and
system configurations are invented for teaching and do not correspond to any
real plant. See docs/MODEL_LIMITATIONS.md.
